## Apryl

In my current main music project, Apryl, I explore atmospheric synth
pads and melodies that I combine with frantic rhythms. I also love doing
more ambient and spacey tracks, and integrate guitar into it.

The [debut album](https://apryl.bandcamp.com/album/apryl) was released
in December 2023 after years of work. After a long wait, the latest
single, [Jog](https://apryl.bandcamp.com/album/jog), came out in 2025,
with more coming soon. Tracks are released on streaming services and
Bandcamp.

I've also been creating live sets to perform Apryl tracks.

[Links to streaming and more](https://linktr.ee/aprylmusic) [Bookings &
Inquiries](mailto:aprylprobably@gmail.com)

## Audio engineering

On the side, I do freelance mixing and mastering work. With my own music
often involving layered, effects-heavy compositions, I particularly
focus on improving clarity and punch while keeping a natural and organic
feel. My mixing style is fairly transparent, and I greatly value
preserving the artist's original intent. I'm keen to work closely with
you to ensure the final product is sounding exactly how you want,
including at the production stage where needed.

If you're interested in getting me involved with your project, please
get in touch! Electronic music is where most of my experience is,
however I am open to any genre. Feel free to reach out if you have any
questions or want to know if I'm a good fit for your project!

[Email me](mailto:declancarveth@gmail.com)

